"Aulia Velra is the S-rank matriarch and head of the Velra family."
"She ran for President of the Anesidoran High Council a few years ago and lost badly."
"Her public email address answers with an autoreply."
"Her son is Corin Velra; Aimi, Keiko, Hazel and Lute are among her descendants."
"Hazel Velra is her favorite descendant."
"She cast the Gloss on her family; only she can complete that luck wordchain."
"She has a Healer who does full rejuvenation, and her family basically is his list."
"She holds that people brought into the family's orbit by powerful chains are cosmically ordained."
"She disliked Keiko's plan and sent Lute to watch Alden Thorn so he would not run."
"She sent Alden an uncomfortably warm letter welcoming him to Anesidora as a neighbor."
"After the Gloss she lost the Unified Rares and Uniques council seat she held for decades."
"Lawsuits followed the Gloss, and old Velra scandals resurfaced."
"Lute calls her the Grandwitch; she emails Alden offers and invitations he declines."
"As far as anyone knows, she had used the Gloss only twice before."
